# test_state_normalized_dag.py AI Check

- [ ] Demo unseen annotation produces a PASS sidecar with zero model/Devin/DB/Solver/file-write side effects.
- [ ] State-normalized DAG annotation is sidecar-only and does not mutate the reasoning DAG.
- [ ] Normalized occurrences absent from the DAG fail closed.
- [ ] Non-PASS state-normalization evaluations fail closed before DAG annotation.
- [ ] Normalized-bundle tampering and duplicate state bindings fail closed.
- [ ] CLI demo emits an auditable JSON receipt.
- [ ] Module imports no model, Solver, database, network, or subprocess dependency.
